.DS_Store
node_modules

# Production-generated content. These files are written on the server by the
# admin dashboard (post images, gallery images, notices, CV uploads). Tracking
# them made every deployment re-assert a frozen snapshot of this directory over
# the live one, which is why admin-uploaded media disappeared after each push.
# Code belongs in git; uploaded content belongs on the server only.
# uploads/.htaccess stays tracked because it is security config, not content.
uploads/*
!uploads/.htaccess
